    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Welcome.Title">Welcome to GuideCraft</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Welcome.Subtitle">Get started in 4 steps: turn your idea into a runnable automation script</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Welcome.Step1Title">Configure API Key</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Welcome.Step1Text">Click ⚙ Settings in the top-right corner and get a free Key from Alibaba Bailian (Qwen) or DeepSeek</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Welcome.Step2Title">Describe your idea</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Welcome.Step2Text">Tell me what you want to automate in one sentence. I will guide you to clarify details step by step</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Welcome.Step3Title">Confirm the summary</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Welcome.Step3Text">I generate a structured requirement document; after your confirmation, the Python code is written automatically</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Welcome.Step4Title">Export &amp; run</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Welcome.Step4Text">Export the project as a ZIP with one click, install dependencies, and run your automation script</sys:String>
